<title>POLAND: Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine stocks fell, three rose and four were flat in 14.3-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units eased 0.7 percent in a 27.7-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
